@baseUrl = http://localhost:5172

### Get all tastings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Tastings

### Get a tasting by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Tastings/15

### Create a tasting
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Tastings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hostId": 1,
  "date": "2026-12-27",
  "time": "19:00:00",
  "capacity": 8,
  "cancelled": false,
  "keyStatus": "available"
}

### Delete a tasting
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Tastings/15